Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A PR that bills a cart of three as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see the fix. The PR page can't help you write it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So reviewers describe the fix in prose…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,…or hand-build a suggestion block, indentation and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead: fix it in the file. Your LSP, your formatter, your keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one key turns the edit into the suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Posted — and the edit is undone. Your tree matches the PR again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,review-mode.nvim
